WEBVTT

00:00:09.390 --> 00:00:10.490
Sup.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:13.400
Why the long face?

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:15.350
You don't need to be afraid of me.

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.470
I've been looking for you.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.420
I really wanted to see you.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:37.260
Keisuke.

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:47.270
Y'know, Akira...

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.730
You're really self-centered.

00:00:51.640 --> 00:00:53.510
You really are.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:58.870
Now that I've become strong, I thought I could show you that.

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:01.800
It's been fun so far.

00:01:02.270 --> 00:01:04.970
Seeing you like that for the first time.

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:09.230
Akira, I got stronger...

00:01:09.850 --> 00:01:11.300
For your sake.

00:01:12.450 --> 00:01:13.760
Much stronger.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:21.260
You're wrong, Keisuke.

00:01:21.550 --> 00:01:23.310
That's not real strength!

00:01:27.920 --> 00:01:29.810
Hey Akira...

00:01:29.810 --> 00:01:31.060
I think...

00:01:31.500 --> 00:01:34.570
...there are more expressions you could show me.

00:01:35.650 --> 00:01:36.860
Akira!

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:42.480
Your troubled, agonized, dying face!

00:01:42.480 --> 00:01:43.580
Show it to me!

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:46.660
Won't you, Akira!?

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:33.000
Distractions day after day, it's always something

00:02:28.670 --> 00:02:33.000
Meutsuri Shiteru Hibi Are Kore

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:37.140
and no one has even realized that

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:42.160
I see the crimson trailing down your cold skin

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:42.160
Awadatsu Hada wo Tsutai Ochiru CRIMSON

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:46.350
Why do you want another punishment?

00:02:42.350 --> 00:02:46.350
Why do you want Atarashii Batsu wo

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:51.100
The sweet fragrances that are drifting about

00:02:46.980 --> 00:02:51.100
Tadayou Amai Kaori wo Tada

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:55.660
I just want to leave them be

00:02:51.590 --> 00:02:55.660
Asobasete Itai Dake Nano sa

00:02:56.160 --> 00:03:03.340
Someone hurry up and shoot me

00:02:56.160 --> 00:03:03.340
Dareka Boku wo Hayaku Uchinuite yo

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:08.490
Show me a gunshot strong enough to make a hole

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:08.490
Show me Kantsuushita Juusou Ana ga Aku Hodo

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:12.960
I crush my thorny grip

00:03:08.710 --> 00:03:12.960
Toge Darake no GRIP Nigiritsubushite

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:18.730
and load bullets that look like ripe flowerbuds

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:18.730
Osanai Mada Tsubomi no You na Dangan de

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:22.840
Let me shoot through the soul

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:22.840
Let me, shot through the soul

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:27.790
and dye it rose

00:03:23.580 --> 00:03:27.790
Bara-iro ni Somare

00:03:53.410 --> 00:03:54.970
Up until now,

00:03:55.380 --> 00:03:58.520
I never really understood what living is.

00:03:59.350 --> 00:04:03.120
Just that death is something that comes after you've lived.

00:04:04.980 --> 00:04:06.130
What's this about?

00:04:06.770 --> 00:04:08.800
What are you talking about?

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:12.750
When you left the hotel, I thought

00:04:13.660 --> 00:04:16.160
that's not what I meant to say.

00:04:18.110 --> 00:04:21.210
But, I couldn't say it right.

00:04:21.780 --> 00:04:25.020
When I realized it, you were gone.

00:04:27.250 --> 00:04:28.070
Keisuke.

00:04:28.070 --> 00:04:29.360
Shut up!

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:42.990
Keisuke.

00:04:42.990 --> 00:04:47.980
You thought that I hated you.

00:04:53.130 --> 00:04:54.770
Of course!

00:04:54.770 --> 00:04:59.800
I was just a weakling who was clinging on to you.

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:03.360
You must have been laughing at me.

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:04.020
You're wrong!

00:05:05.740 --> 00:05:09.890
I never detested you. Not even once.

00:05:10.740 --> 00:05:14.700
But I didn't really know anything about you.

00:05:15.460 --> 00:05:17.320
Even though we were always together.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:18.910
Nothing.

00:05:19.550 --> 00:05:21.360
Too bad, so sad.

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:24.710
I was like your pet, wasn't I?

00:05:25.180 --> 00:05:30.140
You played with me whenever you wanted to and pushed me away when I became a burden.

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:32.170
Was it fun?

00:05:39.470 --> 00:05:40.530
Don't!!

00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:45.020
Why?!

00:05:45.020 --> 00:05:47.270
Why are you doing this to yourself?

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:51.490
I never once thought of you like that!

00:05:51.490 --> 00:05:52.780
Shut up already!

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:04.400
You were always putting yourself down.

00:06:05.390 --> 00:06:08.050
I didn't like that.

00:06:08.860 --> 00:06:11.920
That's what I didn't like at all!

00:06:14.690 --> 00:06:17.710
Friends don't need to make comparisons like that!

00:06:17.710 --> 00:06:19.850
Things were fine the way they were.

00:06:20.160 --> 00:06:21.590
That's what I thought.

00:06:22.840 --> 00:06:26.230
I didn't demand anything else from you.

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:29.340
I didn't care about strength.

00:06:30.420 --> 00:06:33.100
You were fine the way you were!

00:06:33.100 --> 00:06:34.980
That's what I've been trying to tell you!

00:06:41.430 --> 00:06:45.870
But I took being together with you for granted.

00:06:46.660 --> 00:06:49.470
I didn't understand you at all.

00:06:49.470 --> 00:06:50.780
That's a lie.

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:53.290
You're lying!

00:06:55.410 --> 00:06:57.340
Didn't I say it?

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:01.060
I hate you, Akira.

00:07:02.320 --> 00:07:06.650
So who gives a fuck if you've realized that or not?!

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:09.390
Stop belittling me like that.

00:07:09.390 --> 00:07:10.520
Keisuke...

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:16.320
When you disappeared, it hit me for the first time.

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:18.170
Won't you just shut up already?

00:07:19.780 --> 00:07:23.740
I think we all want to have something to live for.

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:26.250
Things we want to protect.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.730
Things we want to have.

00:07:27.730 --> 00:07:29.210
Anything will do.

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:30.670
Shut up.

00:07:31.050 --> 00:07:34.560
I want to leave this place with you.

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:36.240
That's why...

00:07:36.840 --> 00:07:38.380
Neither of us can die here!

00:07:39.590 --> 00:07:40.880
SHUT UP!!

00:07:57.260 --> 00:07:59.360
Hate me more.

00:07:59.920 --> 00:08:02.150
You should hate me

00:08:02.970 --> 00:08:04.870
as much as I hate you.

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:08.330
All you have is half-hearted emotions.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:11.250
Like this and this!

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:11.970
And this!

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:16.040
Get serious about this already!

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.550
I didn't

00:08:21.340 --> 00:08:24.140
come here to kill you!

00:08:26.550 --> 00:08:28.140
Stop making fun of me!

00:08:35.310 --> 00:08:40.010
Why don't we have a little fun?

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:41.870
More pain!

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:43.810
More struggling!

00:08:43.810 --> 00:08:45.140
Keisuke.

00:08:45.140 --> 00:08:47.240
Let's leave Toshima.

00:08:47.240 --> 00:08:50.540
Didn't I tell you to stop belittling me, Akira?!

00:08:53.530 --> 00:08:56.000
You're always like that...

00:09:00.570 --> 00:09:02.630
Akira...

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:14.390
Keisuke.

00:09:20.740 --> 00:09:21.780
Keisuke.

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:25.780
...strongly rejected...

00:09:25.780 --> 00:09:27.990
What will you do if Keisuke dies?

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:31.090
No...

00:10:11.340 --> 00:10:13.830
Keisuke.

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.930
Become a soldier for the sake of your country.

00:10:36.260 --> 00:10:38.300
That's what they kept on saying.

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:42.020
But before I even saw the battlefield,

00:10:42.020 --> 00:10:44.020
the war was already over.

00:10:45.260 --> 00:10:46.990
A sudden time of peace.

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:48.950
And then...

00:10:50.220 --> 00:10:51.240
Akira!

00:10:59.770 --> 00:11:01.980
Mom and Dad, eh...

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:03.620
I wonder what kind of people they are.

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:05.860
What do you think?

00:11:05.860 --> 00:11:07.130
I dunno.

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:10.040
It'd be nice if they were kind.

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:14.390
Oh, and it would be nice if our houses were close by.

00:11:14.390 --> 00:11:14.850
Yeah.

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:17.660
Um, Akira...

00:11:18.340 --> 00:11:22.750
Do you think we can still hang out together?

00:11:24.080 --> 00:11:26.400
Um, s-sorry...

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:28.480
If you want to.

00:11:33.960 --> 00:11:37.730
Total strangers had to act like they were family.

00:11:38.570 --> 00:11:42.670
This sudden family's purpose was to teach me how to kill the enemy.

00:11:44.950 --> 00:11:48.840
That was a regular day in my household.

00:11:48.840 --> 00:11:51.100
It was like living in a lie.

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:54.590
I was taking abuse from unrelated parents.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:56.380
An indifferent,

00:11:56.980 --> 00:12:00.390
artificial family, stuck under the same roof.

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:03.090
Akira!

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:06.760
I'm glad that I caught up with you.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:09.360
D-did something happen?

00:12:10.310 --> 00:12:11.770
No big deal.

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:14.920
It is too a big deal! You can't just leave your home like that...

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:17.160
Did you have a fight with them?

00:12:17.890 --> 00:12:21.000
I don't think living alone is that big of a deal.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:22.420
But...

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:27.960
I'll bring you supplies, Akira.

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:31.790
So you'll have some real food to eat.

00:12:31.790 --> 00:12:33.470
If you don't mind, that is...

00:12:34.840 --> 00:12:37.890
Don't worry about it.

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:39.850
Okay.

00:12:44.060 --> 00:12:44.980
But...

00:12:45.910 --> 00:12:50.320
Even though the world we grew up in was covered in lies,

00:12:51.530 --> 00:12:55.740
the time we spent together wasn't a lie.

00:12:57.610 --> 00:12:59.500
It was something genuine.

00:13:01.950 --> 00:13:04.610
Isn't that right,

00:13:09.570 --> 00:13:10.650
Keisuke?

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:20.440
Keisuke.

00:14:38.450 --> 00:14:39.780
Keisuke!

00:14:39.780 --> 00:14:40.930
Don't touch me!

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.360
Give me...

00:14:49.060 --> 00:14:51.060
Give me... Line...

00:14:52.030 --> 00:14:53.010
Line.

00:14:53.550 --> 00:14:54.530
I need Line.

00:14:57.930 --> 00:14:58.820
Keisuke!

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:01.820
Where are you hiding it?!

00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:02.950
Out of the way!

00:15:02.950 --> 00:15:04.040
Line!

00:15:04.450 --> 00:15:06.410
Where is Line?!

00:15:09.210 --> 00:15:10.710
Try to endure it.

00:15:51.270 --> 00:15:52.600
Pain...

00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:54.670
Please... Please...

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:55.800
Let me have...

00:15:56.130 --> 00:15:57.400
I'm begging you.

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:58.420
Save me.

00:16:01.140 --> 00:16:02.380
I can't let you take more.

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:04.130
Please...

00:16:04.570 --> 00:16:05.920
It hurts...

00:16:06.500 --> 00:16:08.350
It feels like I'm gonna die.

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:09.950
I can't.

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:11.400
Try to bear it.

00:16:13.970 --> 00:16:17.340
Then you might as well kill me!

00:16:18.130 --> 00:16:20.030
Please! Kill me!

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:23.860
Keisuke!

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:28.210
Try to hang on, Keisuke!

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:45.840
Please don't die,

00:16:46.960 --> 00:16:47.980
Keisuke.

00:16:55.600 --> 00:16:56.680
Akira?

00:16:56.680 --> 00:16:58.570
It's me, Keisuke.

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.880
I'm coming in.

00:17:28.900 --> 00:17:29.760
Akira!

00:17:30.370 --> 00:17:31.330
Akira!

00:17:38.660 --> 00:17:39.870
Akira...

00:18:02.110 --> 00:18:03.300
Akira...

00:18:04.080 --> 00:18:05.100
I'm sorry.

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:07.300
No need to apologize.

00:18:10.670 --> 00:18:12.220
But I'm sorry anyway.

00:18:14.470 --> 00:18:16.710
It's all right now.

00:18:16.710 --> 00:18:17.440
Yeah.

00:18:18.640 --> 00:18:20.940
Let's go back together, Keisuke.

00:18:35.090 --> 00:18:37.160
Can you move?

00:18:37.710 --> 00:18:38.670
Yeah.

00:18:41.820 --> 00:18:42.820
Let's go.

00:18:42.820 --> 00:18:44.130
Gramps is waiting.

00:18:56.320 --> 00:18:57.170
Rin?

00:18:58.270 --> 00:18:59.500
What's wrong?

00:18:59.850 --> 00:19:02.160
You're soaking wet.

00:19:03.320 --> 00:19:05.650
Do you want to come with us?

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:07.080
Hey...

00:19:07.740 --> 00:19:08.990
Gimme your tags.

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:10.780
Rin?

00:19:11.320 --> 00:19:14.060
I need tags.

00:19:14.850 --> 00:19:17.410
Akira, you've got a Jack, right?

00:19:18.210 --> 00:19:19.770
What's going on?

00:19:21.560 --> 00:19:23.040
If you don't give them to me, I'll kill you.

00:19:24.070 --> 00:19:26.250
I'm serious.

00:19:27.460 --> 00:19:28.700
What happened?

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:30.590
Enough...

00:19:30.590 --> 00:19:31.430
Hand them over!

00:19:38.880 --> 00:19:40.330
Rin, stop this!

00:19:40.330 --> 00:19:41.520
Shut up.

00:19:41.520 --> 00:19:42.990
Hurry up and give them to me!

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:46.190
I'm going to kill Il Re.

00:19:46.810 --> 00:19:47.650
Il Re...

00:19:50.990 --> 00:19:53.420
That's enough already! Give them to me now!

00:19:55.180 --> 00:19:56.250
All right.

00:19:58.510 --> 00:19:59.790
Let Keisuke go.

00:20:00.670 --> 00:20:02.310
Your tags, too.

00:20:07.380 --> 00:20:08.210
Keisuke!

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:13.820
It's complete now.

00:20:14.850 --> 00:20:15.850
Now...

00:20:16.720 --> 00:20:18.600
Now I can fight him.

00:20:19.110 --> 00:20:20.010
My wish...

00:20:20.400 --> 00:20:21.690
...is finally going to come true.

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:24.220
For them...

00:20:25.380 --> 00:20:26.300
Rin!

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.120
Rin...

00:20:30.120 --> 00:20:31.620
Is he going to die?

00:20:32.260 --> 00:20:33.610
Go, Akira.

00:20:34.360 --> 00:20:36.040
I'll be okay by myself.

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:40.760
I'll go on ahead to Motomi.

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:44.540
You go after Rin.

00:20:47.320 --> 00:20:48.400
Got it.

00:21:00.590 --> 00:21:03.790
Yeahaww! About time a challenger appeared!

00:21:03.790 --> 00:21:07.080
Better start getting ready for it.

00:21:07.450 --> 00:21:08.150
Right?

00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:24.920
Very well.

00:21:25.270 --> 00:21:27.920
I accept your challenge to Il Re.

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:34.550
You're in luck.

00:21:35.650 --> 00:21:40.120
This time, we'll skip the opening act and have a special match.

00:21:41.260 --> 00:21:44.400
You'd best appreciate my leniency with the rules.

00:22:24.750 --> 00:22:29.510
Here in this moonless night,

00:22:31.960 --> 00:22:37.070
we're on the chilling road to tranquillity

00:22:39.580 --> 00:22:44.520
where sadness wounds your heart

00:22:47.040 --> 00:22:52.210
You hide your smile outside

00:22:56.240 --> 00:23:01.800
But every time we happen to meet,

00:23:03.510 --> 00:23:08.470
you hide nothing

00:23:09.030 --> 00:23:13.540
We've been tied in the cold

00:23:13.540 --> 00:23:17.260
Open the door

00:23:17.670 --> 00:23:24.070
to make way for the light

00:23:24.070 --> 00:23:32.280
Tie those broken bonds again

00:23:32.280 --> 00:23:38.690
Don't hide anything

00:23:39.050 --> 00:23:40.730
and don't let go

00:23:50.420 --> 00:23:52.180
What do you think about siblings?

00:23:52.180 --> 00:23:54.520
What do you mean? I have none.

00:23:54.520 --> 00:23:57.220
Wouldn't you like to have some?

00:23:57.220 --> 00:23:59.820
You would make a good big brother, I think.

00:23:59.820 --> 00:24:01.570
Eh? Then would you be the little brother?

00:24:01.570 --> 00:24:03.320
How'd you come up with that?

00:24:01.860 --> 00:24:04.490
Episode 10
